{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition to Madness</strong> is a 1\u20134 player co-op cosmic horror experience that blends survival, exploration, and psychological tension. Step into the boots of an inter-dimensional explorer on a desperate mission to find your missing partner, Emily\u2014lost somewhere in the folds of reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse unstable wormholes into terrifying <strong>parallel dimensions inspired by Lovecraft\u2019s</strong> most iconic stories. From the icy ruins of <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i> to the cursed coastlines of <i>Innsmouth</i>, each mission takes you deeper into a multiverse of horrors and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7e083734f00474d119f6a1509a12b49c.poster.webp?t=1755178048\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7e083734f00474d119f6a1509a12b49c.webp?t=1755178048\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>primordial energy</strong>, recover ancient artifacts, and piece together clues from Emily\u2019s scattered journal. But be warned: unspeakable entities hunt in the dark, and the deeper you go, the harder it is to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/79cd0a2e54a661243f5e854ce118d5ee.poster.webp?t=1755178048\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/79cd0a2e54a661243f5e854ce118d5ee.webp?t=1755178048\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the unknown. Maintain the wormhole. Discover what happened to her\u2026 and what lies beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7a99af4f24906391ccb7d5f09cb24f17.poster.webp?t=1755178048\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7a99af4f24906391ccb7d5f09cb24f17.webp?t=1755178048\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-op:</strong> Venture alone or with up to 3 friends. Every run is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiversal Horror Settings:</strong> Explore shifting dimensions based on Lovecraftian literature, fully rendered in atmospheric first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-Based Survival:</strong> Balance your energy consumption/gathering, and sanity as you extract primordial energy to avoid being trapped in the void forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Discovery:</strong> Uncover Emily\u2019s fate through journal entries, strange phenomena, and clues across worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Enemies:</strong> Face creatures that defy logic\u2014some you can run from, others you must challenge\u2026 or avoid entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression:</strong> Sell primordial energy and alien artifacts to upgrade your equipment and unlock access to deeper, more dangerous dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Objectives:</strong> Choose how to explore, what to extract, and when to escape\u2014if you still can.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383510?t=1755178048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/34555f75ea79da449ff5517778399bbbb8effeb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755178048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/08098d8a167e32094b65a9f2036fda69653d376e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755178048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/08098d8a167e32094b65a9f2036fda69653d376e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755178048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Expedition to madness contains blood and gore, as well as horror themes and occasional nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expedition to Madness</strong> is a 1\u20134 player co-op cosmic horror experience that blends survival, exploration, and psychological tension. Step into the boots of an inter-dimensional explorer on a desperate mission to find your missing partner, Emily\u2014lost somewhere in the folds of reality.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse unstable wormholes into terrifying <strong>parallel dimensions inspired by Lovecraft\u2019s</strong> most iconic stories. From the icy ruins of <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i> to the cursed coastlines of <i>Innsmouth</i>, each mission takes you deeper into a multiverse of horrors and hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7e083734f00474d119f6a1509a12b49c.poster.webp?t=1755178048\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7e083734f00474d119f6a1509a12b49c.webp?t=1755178048\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRACT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>primordial energy</strong>, recover ancient artifacts, and piece together clues from Emily\u2019s scattered journal. But be warned: unspeakable entities hunt in the dark, and the deeper you go, the harder it is to return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/79cd0a2e54a661243f5e854ce118d5ee.poster.webp?t=1755178048\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/79cd0a2e54a661243f5e854ce118d5ee.webp?t=1755178048\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the unknown. Maintain the wormhole. Discover what happened to her\u2026 and what lies beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7a99af4f24906391ccb7d5f09cb24f17.poster.webp?t=1755178048\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/extras/7a99af4f24906391ccb7d5f09cb24f17.webp?t=1755178048\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20134 Player Online Co-op:</strong> Venture alone or with up to 3 friends. Every run is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiversal Horror Settings:</strong> Explore shifting dimensions based on Lovecraftian literature, fully rendered in atmospheric first-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-Based Survival:</strong> Balance your energy consumption/gathering, and sanity as you extract primordial energy to avoid being trapped in the void forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Discovery:</strong> Uncover Emily\u2019s fate through journal entries, strange phenomena, and clues across worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lovecraftian Enemies:</strong> Face creatures that defy logic\u2014some you can run from, others you must challenge\u2026 or avoid entirely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Progression:</strong> Sell primordial energy and alien artifacts to upgrade your equipment and unlock access to deeper, more dangerous dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Objectives:</strong> Choose how to explore, what to extract, and when to escape\u2014if you still can.</p></li></ul>","developers":["MTronners"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/5fb9ac86822e21f03a87a8dfb1ad254f7315206d/header.jpg?t=1755178048","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3383510/1264787875/dbf1557c4904ae445cdea6eb268ab35cab674939/1750781353/dash_av1.m