.jpg?t=1755178048","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/9676d0b37a2f07595e6d5977613f29ca5572552d/ss_9676d0b37a2f07595e6d5977613f29ca5572552d.600x338.jpg?t=1755178048"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/4f1529c864ecde06e84c8956f197ad79a185f05f/ss_4f1529c864ecde06e84c8956f197ad79a185f05f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755178048","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383510/4f1529c864ecde06e84c8956f197ad79a185f05f/ss_4f1529c864ecde06e84c8956f197ad79a185f05f.600x338.jpg?t=1755178048"}],"short_description":"Expedition to Madness is a 1\u20134 player co-op cosmic horror game. Enter unknown dimensions inspired by Lovecraft\u2019s darkest tales to harvest primordial energy and uncover the fate of your missing partner, Emily. Extract alien artifacts, survive terrors, and keep the wormhole open\u2026 or be lost forever.","steam_appid":3383510,"support_info":{"email":"support@mtronners.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":null}